WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.544
The Foundation is a threat to me.

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:03.337
♪♪

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:04.504
(Roaring)
(Screaming)

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:07.883
♪♪

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:08.926
Gaal:
Close your eyes.

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:12.596
Gaal:
Listen to my words.

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:13.639
♪♪

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:17.809
(Unintelligible speaking)

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:18.769
Gaal:
.... foundation.

00:00:19.895 --> 00:00:20.646
Gaal:
And dream.

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:25.192
(Bells ringing)

00:00:25.192 --> 00:00:31.657
♪♪

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:33.242
I want to tell you something. 

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:39.873
Gaal:
A long time ago...a man showed
me how to predict the future.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:43.794
Gaal:
Our foundation to save humanity
was born.

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:48.590
♪♪

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.301
Brother Day:
In my empire there’s a natural
order.

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:54.721
(Crowd cheering)

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.598
The Foundation is a threat to
me.

00:00:58.225 --> 00:01:00.686
Brother Day:
We will destroy them all.

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:08.110
If there’s war, we shall win.

00:01:08.652 --> 00:01:09.152
Hmm.

00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:11.113
♪♪

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.197
(Ships firing lasers)

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:12.739
Woo!

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:18.787
Tellem:
Gaal Dornick you’ve got a very
special mind.

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:23.083
People would follow you, lead
them.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:33.885
♪♪

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:37.347
We will be ready to fight Empire
together.

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:41.435
♪♪

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:42.602
I have faith in foundation

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:46.982
♪♪

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:49.484
The foundation is a cult.

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:51.528
♪♪

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:52.279
(Roaring)

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:54.573
(Screaming)

00:01:54.573 --> 00:01:56.533
The foundation can survive this
crisis,...

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:59.202
♪♪

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:04.082
...but...it requires belief.

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:05.751
♪♪

